// Assembles the Zvid project: a hero scene (city, date, big current temp,
// condition, hi/lo + rain + wind chips) and a 3-day outlook scene (cards
// with icon, weekday, precip, hi/lo). All colours come from the palette
// chosen by `Weather look`. Design language: news-local-update /
// dataviz-project-status from the Zvid template library.

